flowchart TD
    DivUser([Division Legal Officer]) --> RegLabour[Register Industrial Dispute ID/KID<br/>POST /Labour/Create -> Status: 'Pending']
    
    RegLabour --> AdverseAward[Labour Court Award Pronounced]
    AdverseAward --> RecordAward[Enter Award Details & Feasibility<br/>POST /Labour/SaveAwardDetails]

    RecordAward --> ForwardCO[Forward Case Dossier to Central Office<br/>Status: 'Sent_To_CO']

    ForwardCO --> LOReview[Tier 1: Law Officer - LO<br/>GET/POST /Labour/LOAction<br/>Examines Findings & Records Legal Opinion]
    
    LOReview --> LODecision{LO Recommendation}
    LODecision -- Re-examine --> ReturnDiv[Return to Division for Clarifications]
    ReturnDiv --> ForwardCO
    LODecision -- Forward --> DyCLOReview[Tier 2: Deputy Chief Law Officer - Dy CLO<br/>GET/POST /Labour/DyCLOAction<br/>Reviews Precedents & Legal Scrutiny]

    DyCLOReview --> DyCLODecision{Dy CLO Concurrence}
    DyCLODecision -- Query --> LOReview
    DyCLODecision -- Endorse --> CLOReview[Tier 3: Chief Law Officer - CLO<br/>GET/POST /Labour/CLOAction<br/>High-Level Legal Policy & Merits Review]

    CLOReview --> CLODecision{CLO Recommendation}
    CLODecision -- Disagree --> DyCLOReview
    CLODecision -- Recommend --> MDReview[Tier 4: Managing Director - MD<br/>GET/POST /Labour/MDAction<br/>Executive Authority Final Decision]

    MDReview --> MDDecision{Managing Director Order}
    MDDecision -- Accept Award --> ImplementAward[Implement Reinstatement / Backwages<br/>Status: 'Award_Implemented']
    MDDecision -- Challenge Award --> FileWP[Instruct Filing High Court Writ Petition<br/>POST /Labour/SaveWritPetition -> Status: 'WP_Filed']

    ImplementAward --> ArisingAppCheck{Does Workman File 33-C(2)?}
    ArisingAppCheck -- Yes --> ArisingApp[Register Labour Arising Application<br/>POST /Labour/SaveArisingApplication<br/>Track Installment Computations & Ledger]
    ArisingAppCheck -- No --> LabourCaseClosed([Labour Dispute Formally Closed])
    
    FileWP --> TrackHC[Track High Court Writ Petition & Contempt CCC Cases]
    TrackHC --> LabourCaseClosed
